orkui/template/revised-frontend/style/fonts/EBGaramond-Regular.woff2
  EB Garamond by the EB Garamond Project Authors (Georg Duffner, Octavio Pardo).
  License: SIL Open Font License 1.1.
  Source: https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/ebgaramond
    (EBGaramond[wght].ttf)
  Modifications: static instance cut at wght 400 from the variable font with
    fontTools.varLib.instancer, then SUBSET to the ranges below and converted to
    WOFF2. Subsetting dropped 976 of 3,247 glyphs — full Cyrillic and assorted
    symbol blocks that no ORK persona uses — taking the file from 154 KB to 101 KB
    with the certificate's own coverage unchanged (verified: the same 4 personas
    fail to render before and after, all of them Hangul/runic/enclosed-alphanumeric).
    All OpenType layout features and all name records are retained.
    Kept: U+0020-007E, U+00A0-024F, U+0250-02FF, U+0300-036F, U+0370-03FF,
    U+1E00-1EFF, U+2000-206F, U+20A0-20BF, U+2100-214F, U+2190-21FF, U+2212.

